    "title": {
      "en": "Ringed or Little Ringed Plover?"
    },
    "text": {
      "en": "Look at the legs and eye ring first: Ringed has orange legs, Little Ringed yellow-pink. Little Ringed has a bright yellow eye ring, a thin dark bill and no white wing bar. In flight, the Ringed Plover shows a bold white stripe along the wing. The call is different too: a soft fluting double note for Ringed, a sharp, falling “pew” for Little Ringed."
    }
  },
