  "outside": {
    "en": "Visit a beach or shingle bank in May or an estuary in winter and compare as many plovers as you can. Learn the three calls: Ringed (“too-li”), Grey (“tlee-oo-ee”) and Golden (“tlu”). If you can, find a flock of Golden Plovers on a field and look for the white armpits."
